----Vs

tuple - like array
     - collection of different types of value
		     =================
     - index based 
     - immutable - we can't add/modify/delete nth data
     - ()

emp_details = (101,'Mr.ABC',1000.34,True) <== tuple - fixed record set

-----Vs 
dict - like hash / maps /json object
     - collection of different types of value
     - key based 
     - key:value //data
     - mutable - we can add/modify/delete nth data
     - {}
